            ("Two decades running", '<p>The festival has run annually for two decades, becoming a fixture of Toronto\'s summer festival calendar and a major showcase for the city\'s Latin American community along the same stretch of St. Clair West that\'s also home to <a href="corso-italia.html">Corso Italia</a>.</p>'),
